# Integral Agent — environment template (embed mode)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Embed mode: jvagent runs in-process inside integral's backend. The
# host (backend) owns the process environment — it loads ONLY
# `backend/.env` at startup. This `agent/.env` is NOT auto-loaded;
# putting keys here will have NO EFFECT on the running process.
#
# Wire jvagent runtime keys (OPENAI_API_KEY, OPENAI_MODEL, etc.) in
# `backend/.env` instead. This file is kept as a reference to the
# legacy standalone-runtime layout and as a placeholder if/when the
# embed surface gains a documented per-agent env loader.
#
# Standalone runtime users (`jvagent .` from this directory) still
# read this file; ignore the warning above in that case.

# Required by the cockpit's openai_lm action under standalone mode.
# Under embed mode, set OPENAI_API_KEY in backend/.env instead.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional model override (jvagent's default: gpt-4o-mini).
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
